1cd900e984" facs="#m-bbd7c096-ddf4-463f-acae-4485778567fd" label="text-like">Out of Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-51e216b6-b6c8-4be5-844b-e66785d70230" facs="#m-e4f1f841-18b2-45d9-a5ea-6685a1acaea3" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-abf83fc9-0248-4818-bfea-e43b7ed87353" facs="#m-e4e13403-f305-4df2-b168-f5f9044c1fcd" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-ee8f2356-ba92-4032-9fdb-bb7fcc0111fc" facs="#m-b9773f99-e229-4a5d-92be-704ac12b8d50" label="ambiguous">—</l><l xml:id="m-c3d13a04-a211-4da9-8a77-bb4844c27add" facs="#m-257f09bf-0b9c-4bc6-9265-91359130d640" label="lyrics-like">Osu-ísti, Dómi-ne, *Super cá-put é-jus, Posu-í¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ef463a7-77db-4a4b-841b-f87d7fa68583" facs="#m-9642f2d1-24fe-4d5b-a341-f661a6c6d4ba" label="lyrics-like">sti. V. Co-rónam de lápide pre-ti-óso. Super. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-e9ba67f6-7fef-4c69-af9c-0e78e91c3345" facs="#m-459239a0-c1c5-4789-b4e0-a06edf7e99cc" label="lyrics-like">v. Mágna est glória éjus in salutári túo.</l><l xml:id="m-4a3c9687-3cc2-4cc3-b34f-3f655916a1b0" facs="#m-f3cc7ae6-62e1-4a22-9c72-f69f53a75256" label="lyrics-like">K. Glóriam et mágnum decórem impónes super éam.</l><l xml:id="m-1f3c7eb5-1ac0-4c91-a12d-13864df7a0af" facs="#m-e0c86e36-59f4-4997-a9fe-26ab2739f831" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-6b62802b-1653-4eb6-9a77-e76abfc3e0fa" facs="#m-a2a3eebe-bc95-4528-b145-9b60894a3f95" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. I. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G. p. 133. — 2. Laudáte púeri. 7. a.</l><l xml:id="m-53b4732d-5f3a-4b1f-9321-9c318e017cdc" facs="#m-c77b35c2-d4dc-42eb-81c9-e5ae3bd2855b" label="lyrics-like">p. 151. — 3. Laetátus sum. 8. c. p. 173. — 4. Nisi Dóminus. I. f. p. 175.</l><l xml:id="m-49e46c25-becb-41d3-b894-b2f6cb5ec1be" facs="#m-18c6de2a-4a3b-4734-aec3-c22b63c9a815" label="lyrics-like">— 5. Lauda Jerúsalem. 3. ar. p. 204.</l><l xml:id="m-ec31bd4d-63e9-45ef-a1af-151a59c39c4b" facs="#m-098fd857-b4f7-4066-8078-2734b73b4f07" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-cc6b79f5-11b6-4e56-b49a-fad99a40aa40" facs="#m-6ad922e6-e022-413b-8518-a63920e5c4d1" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-2bf25a66-ab4f-4ee6-acc6-9416d8320cd6" facs="#m-23271444-2914-4a36-8de3-0979de517db6" label="lyrics-like">A Cce Jo-ánna, * vírgo símplex et pi-issima, quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1de1290-bb35-4724-bc4f-4ee06a1a129a" facs="#m-19334586-f2ed-421e-8c60-481ecc1eb919" label="lyrics-like">ni-am timé-bat Dóminum valde, nec é-rat qui loque-ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-844a767e-be19-4eb7-b7af-1dd3464fc384" facs="#m-9a60e11b-3e41-475d-a878-9fcaa767973b" label="lyrics-like">tur de illa t vérbum má-lum, alle lú-ia. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-c083b6c3-b6c7-4017-9c07-62ecc94d5ef3" facs="#m-02f2c912-1a48-47df-b598-3ac74124ff2f" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.¡</l><l xml:id="m-196cbb21-a210-4e7a-8672-9de90fa71d84" facs="#m-0a6c764e-5bfc-4e98-924b-edf90378c005" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-9d47868b-41bf-4b62-a628-d719949ed63b" facs="#m-8bf8d7e9-a1f5-47f8-89ac-af8624fd1515" label="lyrics-like">t vérbum má-lum. Usci-tá-vit é-am Dóminus,“ et</l><l xml:id="m-8e4f6bbf-90b3-4445-94ed-64318e972369" facs="#m-4dd83b36-32fa-4fdd-99d0-9f1c1c16d13f" label="lyrics-like">ide-pu-élla índu-it arma-túram Dé¬i, ut pósset</l><l xml:id="m-68e38073-4f86-4ce9-ae5c-630686a4fffe" facs="#m-05cb6f21-a42c-42cf-8da7-03e706f551f5" label="lyrics-like">stá-re advérsus insí-di-as t in-imicó-rum, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-7048e75f-d303-4527-8130-eaac7189483e" facs="#m-a5c828fb-f723-4f74-9336-4bc2ce9392bc" label="ambiguous">18. Ant.8-—</l><l xml:id="m-743d6ed1-7ed1-4ee5-9723-fc6801708dbe" facs="#m-5e77f8b5-9f48-4d5c-bb3a-2a44a2e69787" label="ambiguous">s. e</l><l xml:id="m-26339741-c386-4a90-aa81-29c49dd78e71" facs="#m-eef37927-2ddc-4225-97ad-66a951e25dae" label="lyrics-like">Té- tit“ succíncta</l><l xml:id="m-824d1280-62c3-4cfa-891f-69c1fb9907ba" facs="#m-985fd792-6691-4718-a71e-9454e051ab29" label="lyrics-like">E u o u a e. f in-imicó-rum.</l><l xml:id="m-8aecea47-e682-44b1-8397-317c20d4e57e" facs="#m-88bb9403-ba2c-494d-92ff-3ffdf2dd6072" label="ambiguous">5</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
